  "Header": "HMC-CEC-V2.2",
  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "Description": "Communicating Entities in Context: an Entity - a human in a real audio-visual scene or a Machine represented by a Portable Avatar - communicates with a Machine, possibly in a different Context (language, culture). The scene is described and integrated, Entity and Context Understanding understands the Entity and its Context, Text-and-Speech Translation translates its speech or text, Entity Dialogue Processing produces the response of the Machine, Text-to-Text Translation translates it, and Response and Scene Rendering makes the Portable Avatar that utters it.",
